# content of the same geometry, and still turn red on real reproduction errors? A synthetic "reference" (gradient,
# accent disc with glow, headline, subtitle, logo, camera push-in) is rendered, then a content swap (original words
# fitted to the same ink width, original logo of the same box and area) and seven controlled faults. Every variant is
